<title>USA: Multi Solutions forms subsidiary.</title>
<headline>Multi Solutions forms subsidiary.</headline>
<dateline>MONMOUTH JUNCTION, N.J. 1996-08-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Multi Solutions Inc said on Wednesday that it formed NetCast Inc, an Internet development subsidiary company.</p>
<p>NetCast will develop new Internet technologies to create a series of products and businesses that will extend the power of advertising on the Internet.</p>
<p>Multi Solutions said that NetCast will redefine the advertising business on the Internet.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610.</p>
</text>
